  "content": "<p><span><span>歡迎。</span></span></p><p><span><span>這個新模組源自於改善《世界戰士》的構想，為遊戲增加了新的機制、頭目與能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>本模組尚未完成，將會持續定期更新。</span></span></p><p><span><span>由於動畫數量眾多，模組有大量的依賴項。</span></span></p><p><span><span>依賴項及其相容版本如下：</span></span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span><span>- 點擊各項即可直接下載 -</span></span></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/download/6145747\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>epicfight-forge-20.9.7-1.20.1</span></span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight/download/5889471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>WeaponsOfMiracles-20.1.8.5.6</span></span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-wukong-moveset/download/6451882\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>wukong-forge1.20.1-20.2.0</span></span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection/download/6472836\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>EpicFight-Resurrection-forge1.20.1-0.1.28-hotFix1</span></span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sword-soaring/download/5626433\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>sword_soaring-forge1.20.1-20.1.11.11</span></span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon/download/6427022\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>refm-0.2.15-1.20.1</span></span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset/download/5819718\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>falchionmoveset-20.8.2</span></span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span><span>GeckoLib</span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span><span>目前，並非所有依賴項都與最新版本的 Epic Fight 相容，但一旦它們相容，世界戰士 2 模組將會更新以與最新版本的依賴項相容。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span><span>本模組已關閉留言功能，僅回覆有助於或對模組有貢獻的訊息。</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/EMYfNytN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span><span>¡¡¡DISCORD!!!</span></span></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guerreros-del-mundo-2/files/6865975\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span><span>這裡可以查看最新更新的更新說明！ :D</span></span></span></span></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span><span>這裡可以看到模組新增的第一套盔甲套裝。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ln7xptqot0Y\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span>在這些結構中，你將找到頭目和 NPC</span></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>- 孫悟空競技場 - 森林荒地</span></span></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1239499/description_90717c39-d5f4-4e11-a293-5460e41837a8.png\" alt=\"Monkey King Arena - Plains\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>- 忍者猴競技場 / 交易 - 花卉森林</span></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1239499/description_78cf2c33-fb90-4c3f-8b73-0b38cdf3410e.png\" alt=\"Ninja Monkey Arena - Sunflower Plains\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>- 浪人競技場 / 交易 - 向日葵平原</span></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1239499/description_d6076039-7272-4e60-9ca3-64b3f26457c4.png\" alt=\"Ronin Arena - Sunflower Plains\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>- 呂布競技場 - 惡地</span></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1239499/description_52074743-7551-4904-9509-575759ae6068.png\" alt=\"Arena General Lu-Bu - Badlands\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>- 旗本競技場 - 竹林</span></span></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1239499/description_f3825d3a-ebaa-4cb4-b851-3e7eca56d8ff.png\" alt=\"Dark Hatamoto Arena - Bamboo Jungle\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>- 重吉寺 - 櫻花樹林</span></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1239499/description_701cdf1a-7067-4301-89cd-d81c9e7a6f9d.png\" alt=\"Templo Shigekichi - Cherry Grove\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>",
